WEBVTT

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.110
Wait!

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:15.890
Okay, go ahead.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:26.490
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:47.980
Reikenzan: Hoshikuzu-tachi no Utage

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:56.620
We drew a scribbled map of the future with no defined end

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:03.320
But you smiled saying, "no matter how lost we get,

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:06.840
or how much we cry, the end will come"

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:14.000
If tomorrow was an untouched white canvas

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:19.710
I'd like to see what kind of colors would shine the brightest

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:24.060
Like tears leaving behind a rainbow

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:30.000
I'll prove to you I can change this world

00:01:30.130 --> 00:01:34.330
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:37.370
Listening to the footsteps of a tomorrow

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:41.550
whose name we've yet to know

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:54.140
That's why there aren't any skills like that
included in the Amorphic set of techniques.

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:59.010
I'm gonna teach you a set
of Qingong for the average person.

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:04.610
You won't be able to use sword
control until the Foundation Stage,

00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:10.020
so what I'm about to teach you will be useful.

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:13.990
It's called the Entangling Steps.

00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:18.830
You'll be able to use it to run and climb with ease,

00:02:18.830 --> 00:02:23.530
and overcome your opponent
in a fight through agility.

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:33.920
Entangling Steps is a rather complicated technique
that requires a great deal of balance and flexibility.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:37.190
However, Oriku, with his bright mind
and two years worth of training,

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:41.050
managed to get the hang of it fairly quickly.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:46.930
Great work, you pretty much
nailed the basics on the first day.

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:49.690
All you've gotta do now is practice.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:54.200
I'll bring you some Divine Grass again, as thanks.

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:55.590
It should sell for a pretty penny.

00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:02.200
If only I still had the money from
our radish sales two years ago.

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:05.870
<i>What? Have you already spent it all?</i>

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:12.610
Right now, the only thing keeping the inn from going
under is the money I get from selling the Divine Grass.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:16.290
But whatever, it's just money.

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:19.050
Anyway, practice hard.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:22.180
I'll treat you to stewed pork feet
if you manage to master it.

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:28.120
Oh right, before I go, I want to introduce
you to a new training partner.

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:40.970
Ready, set, go!

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:42.860
Whoops my bad!

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:52.830
You're about to reach the 8th
stage of Amorphic Bones.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:52.330
Episode

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:52.330
The Trial at Azure Cloud Peak

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:58.460
You should be able to get
a breakthrough with my help,

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:00.960
and that of a special item, the Sanguine Berry.

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:01.590
The Sanguine Berry?

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:05.340
You must've already learned about it
in your classes on herbal medicine.

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:10.090
You mean the material commonly
used after the Foundation Stage?

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:11.850
Can I use it? I'm only at the kinesthetic stage.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:17.290
You sure can, but it's not something
you can just go and buy.

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:22.690
You can find some at Azure Cloud Peak,
but it's a storage place of strategic importance.

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:26.320
Even the Chief isn't allowed to freely enter and exit.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.870
But it <i>can </i>be accessible to the lower level disciples.

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:30.820
If you know what I mean.

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:35.370
I'd like to join the Azure Cloud Peak trial
that's being held seven days from now.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:38.380
The Azure Cloud Peak trial? Are you serious?

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:47.760
It's important for even a genius like me
to spend time with my classmates.

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:53.260
<i>What I really mean to say is, the entry level requirement
is that you are at the stage of ki gathering.</i>

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:56.650
<i>You can't join if you're only at the kinesthetic stage...</i>

00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:59.380
What are you staring at?

00:04:57.090 --> 00:05:00.270
Not to mention the fact that you're only
at tier two of the kinesthetic stage.

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:01.650
I know, I know, I'm exceptionally good-looking.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:09.410
<i>As a legacy disciple he's my superior,
how should I break it to him?</i>

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:17.640
Another disciple and I are responsible for taking care of a team of disciples at tier 7 and 8 of the ki gathering stage.

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:22.210
We're only at tier 6, so looking
out for 4 would be a bit much...

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:25.170
Sounds like it'll be hard, but I can help you out.

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:29.930
<i>You're the one that's gonna make my job harder!</i>

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:34.930
<i>There is only one reason for a genius like
me to participate in this kind of trial.</i>

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:41.680
Letting low level disciple into Azure Cloud
Peak is like giving them a little push.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:46.460
It's for those willing to enter
and challenge their limits.

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:50.450
It'll be too hard for someone at your
level to harvest a Sanguine Berry.

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:54.620
But if there's a circumstance that
would require my assistance...

00:05:55.090 --> 00:06:00.630
<i>Everything's ready now. The trial is
seven days away, almost show time!</i>

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:03.330
Weapons for self-defense?

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:06.910
I might have just the one for you.

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:08.210
Now, where did I put it?

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:09.430
Found it!

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:12.560
As a disciple of the Reiken Sect,
you might like this one.

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:15.470
You can take this Crepe-Myrtle sword.

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:18.590
I knew I could count on you!

00:06:18.590 --> 00:06:21.070
I can also teach you the skills to use with it.

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:22.400
I'd really appreciate that.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:26.530
With your potential you should be able
to learn it in the seven days before the trial.

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:27.860
Oriku?

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:34.030
In my position, it was kind of hard
to refuse a legacy disciple.

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:35.350
Let him be.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:37.580
But Elder Ryuken...

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:40.490
If he wants to go, just let him go.

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:45.950
You only need to worry about
the ones you're responsible for.

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:46.760
All right.

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:50.490
There's something different about this sword.

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:54.390
It's known for its similarity to
the swords used in the west.

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:56.600
I should ask that chef about it.

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:59.730
The skill set is called "Cloud Sword".

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:03.360
It's actually kind of related to your boyfriend.

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:05.000
Kai-chan?

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:11.490
This skill set is created by the master swordsmen
in the royal families of the Untai Empire.

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:16.070
Famed for its high defensive
capabilities and flexibility.

00:07:16.070 --> 00:07:20.000
The skills works well with the flexible
swords that are produced in Untai Empire.

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:26.750
I saw how your boyfriend fought in Icewind Valley,
two years ago during the Celestial Gathering.

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:32.760
He used some really impressive Cloud Sword skills,

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:36.510
and even managed to deal a couple
blows to that blizzard mammoth.

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:39.490
But regardless of how great,

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:42.480
martial arts skills can never compare
with the Amorphic swords.

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:46.490
<i>After getting the Sanguine Berry
and making it to the next stage,</i>

00:07:46.490 --> 00:07:53.530
<i>I'll finally be able to see whether these Amorphic
techniques really live up to their hype.</i>

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:57.790
Picking herbs...

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:00.790
Sounds kind of fun, like a picnic!

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:03.700
Not at all, it's a formal trial!

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:06.550
I'm actually quite anxious about what's gonna happen.

00:08:06.550 --> 00:08:10.050
Like, I wonder if they'll provide lunch?

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:14.970
Oh leave it to me! I have some new recipes
that I can use to pack lunch for you guys.

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:19.860
Oh don't bother! There are a bunch of rules so...

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:20.890
I see.

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:25.150
<i>Almost had to go through another kind of trial.</i>

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:30.500
I know Elder Ryuken and Elder Obu
don't always see eye to eye,

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.150
but I never imagined he'd treat
her disciples so ruthlessly.

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:36.820
Oriku was really impressive
during the Celestial Gathering.

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:40.570
Have these past two years at
Amorphic Peak made you air-headed?

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:43.910
Come in.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:48.590
Elder Kaun, what brings you here?

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:56.090
Well, three of my students aren't
racking up enough points

00:08:56.600 --> 00:09:00.470
They'll be expelled from the outer court
at the rate they're going.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:07.860
So I was thinking, maybe I should let them take
the Azure Cloud Peak trial to earn some points.

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:13.650
Elder Kaun, I don't think we'd be
able to take care of that many.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:18.820
Don't worry, I've got someone
to take care of those three.

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:21.130
Well, alright then.

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:26.330
This upcoming trial is kinda making me worried now.

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:36.390
Sorry I'm late, I'm the one who's
gonna take care of these three.

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:37.510
I'm Ryo.

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:39.210
S-Son.

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:40.550
My name is En.

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:45.130
There's still one person not here,
let's introduce ourselves while we wait.

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:46.390
Sounds good.

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:47.810
Everyone please gather.

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.490
Gotcha!

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:05.910
I'm your leader Gaku Un,

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:08.620
I joined the sect a few years before you guys.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.250
I'm currently at tier 6 of ki gathering.

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:15.800
Kaku Ei, same year as Gaku Un,
also tier 6 ki gathering stage.

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:17.300
I'm Shushin.

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:19.470
My name is Bunho.

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:21.550
I'm Gaku Keiyo.

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:22.970
My name is Bun In.

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:26.750
I've never seen you before.

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:30.100
We're outer court disciples, we entered
the sect the same year as you.

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:31.980
Oh I see.

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.490
So cute.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:39.660
And you are? I've never seen a uniform like that.

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:47.410
I'm Ochu, this color's probably
a result of over-washing.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:49.380
And the shoes?

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:52.170
I think they gave me women's shoes by mistake.

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:56.050
But they fit fine, so I kept them.

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:59.370
Well I guess it's fine if you like it,

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:02.360
but you should ask for another uniform set.

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:03.050
Yes.

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:07.340
<i>I dyed it on purpose, you idiots.</i>

00:11:07.340 --> 00:11:10.360
<i>How am I supposed to stand out wearing the same color as everyone else?</i>

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:15.800
<i>It's still nothing compared to
his eye-catching red and white outfit.</i>

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:18.120
Ochu, long time no see.

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:19.990
Young Master!

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:21.890
You're late.

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:25.870
I'm sorry, I did a bit of warming up
with a bear on the mountain.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:27.240
A bear?

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:35.220
Well everyone's here, let's go.

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:37.130
I'll be leading in the front,

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:39.660
while Kaku Ei will be following in the back.

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:44.200
Please make a line according to your stages.

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:45.390
I want be in the front.

00:11:46.980 --> 00:11:49.490
Is that legacy disciple really okay?

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:51.640
He won't listen to me.

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:55.060
All right then, please follow closely.

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:12.500
<i>This is a space cut and connected by the ancient
Reiken elders using spells of the highest level.</i>

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:16.590
<i>The Shukuchi that Oriku uses every day
is a miniature version of it.</i>

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:22.330
<i>The place where trial will take place
is mainly used for growing rare herbs,</i>

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:25.510
and as habitat for some low level monsters.

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:32.350
And we're here.

00:12:40.330 --> 00:12:43.980
The trial will last for 5 days.

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:47.470
The plan is to cross the Full Moon Valley
into the Azure Dragon Gorge,

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:48.740
then turn back at the Lotus Lake.

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:52.410
Feel free to pick some herbs at that time.

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:56.090
The entire place is under the
protection of the Spell of Decree.

00:12:56.090 --> 00:13:00.030
But there are accidents, injuries,
or even deaths every few years.

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:03.920
Please follow the orders of Kaku Ei and myself.

00:13:04.190 --> 00:13:05.930
Let's get started then.

00:13:28.650 --> 00:13:30.370
I feel alive again.

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:40.850
What is that?

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:43.130
You can think of it as letter mail.

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:48.140
We will be heading north from
now on, guess this is goodbye.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:52.650
I really appreciate the help you provided.

00:13:52.650 --> 00:13:53.770
Good luck with the journey.

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:07.610
<i>There's no time at all for herbs!</i>

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:11.780
<i>It's hard enough for us to keep up.</i>

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:16.270
<i>Does he plan to stay at that pace the entire time?</i>

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:20.290
<i>Give me a break, I only came
here to please Elder Kaun.</i>

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:27.800
<i>As expected of low level disciples,
already gasping for air.</i>

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:29.660
<i>Oriku!?</i>

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:32.270
<i>He's keeping up with me.</i>

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:34.680
<i>Well guess that's not surprising
since he's a legacy disciple.</i>

00:14:36.490 --> 00:14:39.060
Sorry, but are we there yet?

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:42.270
What's the matter? Feeling exhausted?

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:45.230
All right, let's take a breather.

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:59.620
They only used about 30 percent of their stamina.
Well, that's to be expected of newbies.

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:06.170
These three put in by Elder Kaun
are the worst of the lot.

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:14.550
So your plan is, to cross Full Moon Valley and head
into the Azure Dragon Gorge in three days right?

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:16.680
Yes.

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:20.440
I don't think we can make it in three days,
at the pace we're going.

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:26.780
Well we can, if we keep it up
for three days without sleep.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:33.500
But at your levels, it's hard to go on
for multiple days without any rest.

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:36.490
So to save time, we've gotta speed up a bit.

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:40.710
If you can reach the Azure Dragon Gorge in a day,

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:42.620
you have the two other days to do as you like.

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:51.800
I'm glad you found your spirit, let's speed up.

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:55.930
<i>The speed is even faster that before.</i>

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:59.920
<i>The leader Gaku Un is at tier 6 of ki gathering.</i>

00:15:59.920 --> 00:16:03.190
<i>Since I'm also at ki gathering,
I didn't expect such a huge difference.</i>

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:07.320
<i>Even though they all seemed exhausted
minutes ago, they're managing to keep up.</i>

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:14.440
<i>Pushing to break your own limits,
and learning to utilize all your strength,</i>

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:16.330
<i>such is the goal of the trial.</i>

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:21.100
Chief, you're here.

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:23.330
I've received a letter from the Seventh Elder.

00:16:23.940 --> 00:16:27.500
Seems he'll be arriving in about a month's time.

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:32.010
I'm looking forward to hearing about his adventures
from all the countries he's traveled through.

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:39.560
Same here. I can finally give back
the Azure Cloud Peak he entrusted me with.

00:16:41.970 --> 00:16:43.920
Didn't I recently hear something somewhere,

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:47.860
that should make me feel concerned
about Azure Cloud Peak?

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:07.200
Good job everyone. Let's take a bit of a rest.

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:11.090
At this speed we should arrive as planned.

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:14.130
Um, Leader,

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:16.930
it's about noon,

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.970
what are we doing about lunch?

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:23.970
There's an abundance of fruits
and vegetables around here.

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:26.850
You can eat as much as you want.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.400
I found some red berries!

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:34.820
So bitter!

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:37.870
I haven't finished talking yet.

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:44.570
The abundance of vegetation also means
there's a lot you don't know about.

00:17:44.570 --> 00:17:48.420
In fact I'd be impressed if you knew
about even a tenth of the plants here.

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:53.590
Whether you can find enough to fill your stomachs
will depend on your marks in herbalism.

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:58.330
That wasn't a red berry, it was a red bramble.

00:17:58.330 --> 00:18:01.100
There are still three steps of process before it's edible.

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:04.520
So everyone, what were your grades in herbalism?

00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:08.520
I only got a C plus in beginner's herbalism.

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:12.240
Beginner's herbalism, B.

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:14.900
I got an A in beginner's herbalism.

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:18.910
Beginner's herbalism, C minus.

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:25.410
Oh we also, in beginner's herbalism,
ended up getting, a C minus!

00:18:25.890 --> 00:18:28.870
Intermediate herbalism, A.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:31.300
An A in intermediate?

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:35.050
That's impressive, much better
than what I got in 2nd year.

00:18:35.470 --> 00:18:38.420
That's nothing.

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:40.930
Well, I guess it's at least better than a C minus.

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:51.930
Feel free to dig in. Not only are these
edible, I picked tasty ones too.

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:53.730
You did?

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:58.630
Professional herbalism, A plus.
It was a piece of cake.

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:01.060
Professional? At the 2nd year?

00:19:01.060 --> 00:19:02.780
Don't ask him about it.

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:07.460
That's only one of the professional subjects I completed.

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:09.270
Only one of them?

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:14.710
I tried to study during my spare time,
so I managed to complete them.

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:21.490
If I finish the western language, I'll have
six A plus scores in professional courses!

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:26.430
After which, if I pass the exams,
I'll get the title of Doctor.

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:30.890
So you're the rumored genius legacy disciple.

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:33.460
That's too much.

00:19:33.460 --> 00:19:35.640
I'm just really nerdy.

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:43.500
<i>Actually, during these past two years spent
as a legacy disciple without restrictions,</i>

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:48.450
<i>after miles of running and soaking
in the medicinal bath everyday,</i>

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:51.620
<i>there was nothing Oriku could do
but kill time with studies.</i>

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:55.040
Thanks for the food!

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:59.300
Please have some.

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:00.880
Thank you very much.

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:02.220
Thank you very much.

00:20:03.990 --> 00:20:08.350
Ochu, when did you start eating so much?

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:10.640
What, I eat however much I want.

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:18.070
Stop looking so happy eating
food you didn't help to find.

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:23.450
I didn't say that.

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:29.540
<i>Oriku, I won't forgive you
if the girls end up disliking me!</i>

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:32.080
Serves you right.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:37.170
Guess I can't feel satisfied without some meat.

00:20:37.530 --> 00:20:39.620
I'll hunt some.

00:20:39.620 --> 00:20:41.140
Really?

00:20:41.140 --> 00:20:44.930
There's lots of animals and monsters around here.

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:49.720
No wait, you can't hunt the animals or monsters here.

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:52.640
You mean they're only for our viewing pleasure?

00:20:53.090 --> 00:20:58.320
This is Azure Cloud Peak,
there are level 2 monsters around.

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:04.950
That's some impressive nerve,
remaining calm after hearing what I said.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:09.850
Sorry, the "Monsters of the Nine Regions Biology"
course has less credits, so I didn't bother to take it.

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:11.700
Is level 2 strong?

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:15.210
Are level 2 monsters strong?
What happened to being a nerd!?

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:20.710
Level 2 is equivalent to somewhere around the top
tier kinesthetic stage, or tier 1 ki gathering stage.

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:24.220
Although close to the average of our stages combined,

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:26.560
if they come in numbers of 2 or 3,

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:30.930
we can only try to run for our lives, under my covering.

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:32.850
Something's moving!

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:36.900
Gaku Un, something's coming near.

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:41.020
I can feel the stir in my Cloud Strings.

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:46.630
But it's weak, I don't think it's something big.

00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:49.780
Still we should take care, nothing is too small.

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:54.410
<i>Newbies, you're exposing yourselves by drawing your swords too early.</i>

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:58.170
No need to panic, let me protect you guys.

00:22:17.890 --> 00:22:23.610
The beat that quivers
within my worn down memory,

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:27.080
Drowns in my slumber,

00:22:27.250 --> 00:22:28.920
sinking below the surface

00:22:29.220 --> 00:22:34.940
My eyes, as they
look up to a pouring sky

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:40.340
Reflect a heart locked
away by the moonlight

00:22:40.680 --> 00:22:51.190
Only my most twisted pain
lies within this weaving infinity

00:22:51.420 --> 00:22:57.630
Bleeding away miserably
as our intertwined fingers untangle

00:22:57.970 --> 00:23:01.360
Clinging to your feelings,

00:23:01.640 --> 00:23:04.560
oh so powerfully

00:23:04.950 --> 00:23:10.120
I'll show you I can go
beyond this rusted world

00:23:10.650 --> 00:23:15.710
The words that pierced
through this permanent illusion

00:23:15.970 --> 00:23:25.810
Resound through my out stretched fingers

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:37.410
"The Disappearance of Obu".

00:23:37.410 --> 00:23:39.240
Waiting for you at the Reiken Mountain.
